  "releaseNotes": "- Fixed a problem with the CustomMedia class clone that was not updating the Load information.\n\t\t  - Improved made token handling more robust for async flows: ActiveTokenStatus now supports storing and exposing session-level identifiers used across the request lifecycle (token / tokenSID) and cooperates with the header propagation pipeline. This reduces boilerplate when bootstrapping calls that need authentication and company context.\n\t\t  - Added thread-safe, async-flow-safe context (AsyncLocal) for outgoing header values and response metadata. Exposes Token, TokenSID, ClientIfNoneMatch and read-only WcfStatusCode/WcfETag slots, plus helpers SetToken, ClearToken, Use and EnsureHeaderBehavior. Designed to centralize header injection and to capture WCF response information for upstream handling.\n\t\t  - Added new endpoint behavior + client message inspector that automatically injects headers into outgoing WCF HTTP requests (Authorization, X-TokenSID, If-None-Match) and captures incoming HTTP response metadata (status code, ETag). The captured values are written into RSEndpointHeaderContext so callers can react (e.g. convert WCF 304 into MVC 304) without repetitive code.",
  "title": "DVO.Core",
